<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-AFRICAN CLUB COMPEITIONS COLLATED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN CLUB COMPEITIONS COLLATED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Collated results of African</p>
<p>club competition matches played over the weekend:</p>
<p>African Super Cup:</p>
<p>Zamalek (Egypt) 0 Arab Contractors (Egypt) 0</p>
<p>(Zamalek won 4-2 on penalties)</p>
<p>African Champions Cup preliminary round, second leg:</p>
<p>Desportivo Travadores (Cape Verde Islands) 2 Mogas 90</p>
<p>(Benin) 0</p>
<p>(Desportivo Travadores won 2-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p>Cafe Band Sportif (Equatorial Guinea) 0 Munisport (Congo) 1</p>
<p>(Munisport won 5-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p>Racing Club Bobo Dialassou (Burkina Faso) 1 Junior</p>
<p>Professionals (Liberia) 0</p>
<p>(Junior Professionals win 2-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p>FC BFV (Madagascar) 3 Saint Michel United (Seychelles) 0 (FC</p>
<p>BFV won 5-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p>Roma Rovers (Lesotho) 5 Limbe Leaf Wanderers (Malawi) 1</p>
<p>(Roma Rovers won 5-2 on aggregate)</p>
<p>Express (Uganda) 1 Young Africans (Tanzania) 0</p>
<p>(Express won 1-0 on aggregate)</p>
<p>African Cup Winners' Cup preliminary round, first leg:</p>
<p>Kivoyu Sports (Rwanda) 2 Bata Bullets (Malawi) 1</p>
<p>(2-2 on aggregate. Bata Bullets won on the away goals rule)</p>
<p>Umeme SC (Uganda) 3 Awassa Flower Mill (Ethiopia) 0 (Umeme SC</p>
<p>won 5-0 on aggregate)</p>
<p>Eleven Men in Flight (Swaziland) 0 MP Tigers (Namibia) 0</p>
<p>(1-1 on aggregate. Eleven Men in Flight won on away goals rule)</p>
<p>Township Rollers (Botswana) 1 Lerotholi Polytechnic</p>
<p>(Lesotho) 0</p>
<p>(Leortholi Polytechnic won 2-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p>Akonangui (Equatorial Guinea) 1 Renaissance (Chad) 4</p>
<p>(Renaissance won 7-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p>Dynamos (Zimbabwe) 3 Sigara SC (Tanzania) 0</p>
<p>(Dynamos won 3-1 on aggregate)</p>
<p>Confederation of African Football (CAF) Cup preliminary</p>
<p>round, first leg:</p>
<p>Dire Dawa Locomotive (Ethiopia) 0 Simba SC (Tanzania) 1</p>
<p>(Simba won 5-1 on aggregate).</p>
</text>
